<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Dream Weaver - Story Generator Terminal</title>
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag 'game', media: 'all' %>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #000000;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    
    body::before {
      content: " ";
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 50%), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.06), rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.02), rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.06));
      z-index: 2;
      background-size: 100% 2px, 3px 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: flicker 0.15s infinite;
    }
    
    .generator-container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      width: 90vw;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 30px;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      border: 3px solid #00ff00;
      box-shadow: 
        inset 0 0 100px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.05),
        0 0 50px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.3);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
    }
    
    .generator-container::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
    }
    
    .generator-title {
      text-align: center;
      color: #00ff00;
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.8);
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-family: 'Courier New', 'Consolas', 'Monaco', monospace;
    }
    
    .ascii-art {
      text-align: center;
      color: #00aa00;
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', 'Consolas', 'Monaco', monospace;
      white-space: pre;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.5);
    }
    
    .generator-subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: #00ff00;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.6);
      border-top: 1px solid #00aa00;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #00aa00;
      padding: 10px 0;
    }
    
    .prompt-form {
      background: rgba(0, 20, 0, 0.3);
      padding: 25px;
      border: 2px solid #00aa00;
    }
    
    .prompt-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #00ff00;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.6);
    }
    
    .prompt-label::before {
      content: "> ";
    }
    
    .prompt-textarea {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 120px;
      font-size: 15px;
      border: 2px solid #00aa00;
      background: #000000;
      color: #00ff00;
      resize: vertical;
      font-family: 'Courier New', 'Consolas', 'Monaco', monospace;
      padding: 12px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.5);
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    
    .prompt-textarea:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #00ff00;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.4);
    }
    
    .prompt-textarea::placeholder {
      color: #006600;
    }
    
    .prompt-examples {
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 15px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      border: 1px solid #00aa00;
    }
    
    .examples-title {
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #00ff00;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.6);
    }
    
    .example-item {
      margin: 10px 0;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      background: #000000;
      border: 1px solid #006600;
      border-left: 3px solid #00aa00;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #00ff00;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      font-family: 'Courier New', 'Consolas', 'Monaco', monospace;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    
    .example-item::before {
      content: "[";
      margin-right: 5px;
    }
    
    .example-item::after {
      content: "]";
      margin-left: 5px;
    }
    
    .example-item:hover {
      background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
      border-color: #00ff00;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.3);
      transform: translateX(5px);
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.8);
    }
    
    .generate-button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 18px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #00ff00;
      background: #000000;
      border: 2px solid #00aa00;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', 'Consolas', 'Monaco', monospace;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.6);
    }
    
    .generate-button:hover {
      background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.15);
      border-color: #00ff00;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.5);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.8);
    }
    
    .generate-button:active {
      background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.25);
    }
    
    .flash-error {
      background: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.2);
      color: #ff3333;
      border: 2px solid #ff0000;
      padding: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'Courier New', 'Consolas', 'Monaco', monospace;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.5);
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    
    .flash-error::before {
      content: "[ERROR] ";
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    .loading-text {
      text-align: center;
      color: #00ff00;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      display: none;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.8);
      animation: blink 1s infinite;
    }
    
    @keyframes blink {
      0%, 49% { opacity: 1; }
      50%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; }
    }
    
    .form-submitting .loading-text {
      display: block;
    }
    
    .form-submitting .generate-button {
      background: rgba(0, 100, 0, 0.3);
      border-color: #006600;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      color: #006600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="generator-container">
    <div class="ascii-art">
╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║                                                                                                    ║
║  ██████╗ ██████╗ ███████╗ █████╗ ███╗   ███╗  ██╗    ██╗███████╗ █████╗ ██╗   ██╗███████╗██████╗   ║
║  ██╔══██╗██╔══██╗██╔════╝██╔══██╗████╗ ████║  ██║    ██║██╔════╝██╔══██╗██║   ██║██╔════╝██╔══██╗  ║
║  ██║  ██║██████╔╝█████╗  ███████║██╔████╔██║  ██║ █╗ ██║█████╗  ███████║██║   ██║█████╗  ██████╔╝  ║
║  ██║  ██║██╔══██╗██╔══╝  ██╔══██║██║╚██╔╝██║  ██║███╗██║██╔══╝  ██╔══██║╚██╗ ██╔╝██╔══╝  ██╔══██╗  ║
║  ██████╔╝██║  ██║███████╗██║  ██║██║ ╚═╝ ██║  ╚███╔███╔╝███████╗██║  ██║ ╚████╔╝ ███████╗██║  ██║  ║
║  ╚═════╝ ╚═╝  ╚═╝╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝     ╚═╝   ╚══╝╚══╝ ╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝  ╚═══╝  ╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝  ║
